Cohen blockchain index drafts:

1) Use git
2) Block - files
3) Files structure example:
./2023/11/17/1.block
…
Every day files to 1 to NNN.block
Time-zone: Europe/Moscow, MSK
4) Block file syntax:
{
   format: ‘cb’, # Cohen block
   version: ‘1’,
   data: {
     url: ‘https://example-domain.org/path’,
     timestamp: ‘2023-11-17 16:29:42’,
     action: ‘visit / like / dislike / comment / publication’,
     publication: ‘optional param for comments or publications ’,
     photo: ‘optional param photo url on blockchain external storage’,
      music: ‘optional url to audio on external storage’,
      video: ‘optional url to video on external web storage’,
       auditors: { 
          Nickname_foo: ‘text’,
          Nickname_bar: ‘so text’
       }
   }
}
